        "Instagram does not import portfolio media in the current normal flow. Work samples are uploaded separately."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Provider conditions",
      "items": [
        "Cloud Vision failures fail closed. Portraits require admin approval for public visibility.",
